Sync gaps to fix
Gap	Impact
Download filename
Frontend saves {key}-report.pdf; backend generates {business-slug}-{key}-{dates}.pdf via Content-Disposition — frontend ignores server filename
Date defaults
Dashboard = today; reports = month-to-date — same business question, different windows
No date validation
date_from > date_to not blocked on either side
Timezone
sale_date / expense_date vs browser toISOString() — edge cases around midnight
No optional filters
No shift_id, user_id (cashier), category_id — limits decision-usefulness
Descriptions vs reality
“Sales transactions with line items” — PDF yes, CSV/XLSX summary only
