Proposed enhancement package (for your approval)
Package A — Accounting & sync (small, high trust)
Add period summary strip to Daily Sales + Expenses PDFs/Excel: Gross, Refunds, Expenses, Net after expenses
Unify labels across dashboard, reports, and frontend (net_sales vs net_after_expenses)
Frontend: read filename from Content-Disposition; align default date range with dashboard (today / 7 days / month presets)
Validate date_from ≤ date_to on both sides
Package B — Decision reports (medium, high value)
New Business Summary (P&L) report — one download answering “Am I making money?”
New Shift Reconciliation report — mirrors ShiftReceiptContent (gross, refunds, net, cash/mobile/card, shift expenses, cash at handover)
New Product Performance report — top/bottom products by net revenue
Package C — Polish & brand (small)
Custosell tagline + Custospark footer on all PDFs/Excel title rows
Each report opens with “Answers: …” one-liner (e.g. Sales Trend → “How did daily net performance change?”)
Insight callouts: best day, refund %, expense ratio, low-stock count
Package D — Filters (medium)
Optional date_from / date_to presets in UI (Today, This week, This month, Custom)
Optional cashier filter on Daily Sales / Payment Breakdown
Optional shift filter on shift report
